out, too, because if we're looking at a smaller rink, there's not going to be room anyways.

278
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:29,980
We can also run, like, a hockey program if we wanted to, where we could teach or just have

279
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:31,120
kids playing at a certain time.

280
00:14:31,180 --> 00:14:31,740
That is okay.

281
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:41,260
