But once winter hits, that's not going to be dark enough where we want the rink, because

291
00:15:00,100 --> 00:15:01,120
that's, like, way out there.

292
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:06,260
So we would need some sort of, like, generator light to go on and off at a certain time.

293
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:11,820
